!include _style.iuml
title NTUST Eats — State Machine: Order
[*] --> SUBMITTED : 送出
SUBMITTED --> ACCEPTED : 店家接單
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : 店家拒絕
SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED : 學生取消
ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : 學生取消
ACCEPTED --> READY : 製作完成 / 通知學生
READY --> PICKED_UP : 取餐
PICKED_UP --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
@enduml
